Here is an example of how we might use Python with the Spotify API to get similar artists:
```python
import spotipy
from spotipy.oauth2 import SpotifyClientCredentials

# Set up Spotify API credentials
client_id = "your_client_id"
client_secret = "your_client_secret"

# Create a Spotify client credentials object
client_credentials_manager = SpotifyClientCredentials(client_id=client_id, client_secret=client_secret)

# Create a Spotify object with the credentials
sp = spotipy.Spotify(client_credentials_manager=client_credentials_manager)

# Define the artist's name
artist_name = "The Beatles"

# Search for the artist
results = sp.search(q="artist:" + artist_name, type="artist")

# Get the artist's ID
artist_id = results["artists"]["items"][0]["id"]

# Get similar artists
similar_artists = sp.artist_related_artists(artist_id)

# Print the similar artists
for artist in similar_artists["artists"]:
    print(artist["name"])
```
This code uses the Spotify API to search for an artist, retrieve their ID, and then get a list of similar artists. The resulting list can be used to generate a tag cloud or recommend music to users.

To include YouTube music videos in the tag cloud, we can use the YouTube Data API to search for videos related to the similar artists. Here is an example of how we might use Python with the YouTube Data API to get video IDs:
```python
import os
import googleapiclient.discovery

# Set up YouTube API credentials
api_key = "your_api_key"

# Create a YouTube API client
youtube = googleapiclient.discovery.build("youtube", "v3", developerKey=api_key)

# Define the artist's name
artist_name = "The Beatles"

# Search for videos related to the artist
request = youtube.search().list(
    part="id,snippet",
    q=artist_name,
    type="video"
)
response = request.execute()

# Print the video IDs
for item in response["items"]:
    print(item["id"]["videoId"])
```
This code uses the YouTube Data API to search for videos related to an artist and retrieve their IDs. The resulting list can be used to generate a tag cloud or recommend music videos to users.

